WEBVTT

00:01:41.660 --> 00:01:45.130
Mudo, it's becoming a bit too cool for sailor uniforms now huh?

00:01:47.600 --> 00:01:50.720
Who do you think is going to win this year's Japan Series?

00:01:52.900 --> 00:01:55.090
Togoku? Or maybe Hiroshima?

00:01:57.650 --> 00:01:58.400
...or maybe not.

00:02:01.460 --> 00:02:05.590
Ah, that's right. Did you know I was a Chiba fan?

00:02:06.430 --> 00:02:07.630
You wouldn't know, right?

00:02:16.710 --> 00:02:18.950
There was a player who had the same name as me.

00:02:19.460 --> 00:02:20.360
He's not there anymore though.

00:02:25.690 --> 00:02:26.250
Mudo?

00:02:29.520 --> 00:02:32.790
Hey, do you know Bro-something Mountain?

00:02:34.990 --> 00:02:37.180
It's a movie made in America.

00:02:38.080 --> 00:02:40.660
Friendship between men sure is beautiful.

00:02:45.630 --> 00:02:46.240
Mudo?

00:02:49.670 --> 00:02:51.080
Is it like this?

00:02:53.840 --> 00:02:56.320
No, maybe it's like this!

00:02:56.840 --> 00:02:57.590
Mudo...

00:02:58.700 --> 00:02:59.960
Or maybe like this...

00:03:00.400 --> 00:03:02.360
Let's go home now, Mudo.

00:03:03.250 --> 00:03:04.330
Kirihara Mudo.

00:03:04.830 --> 00:03:08.480
A shy 14 year-old boy who has yet to touch Potemayo.

00:03:09.700 --> 00:03:15.880
That Lovely Kid

00:03:21.150 --> 00:03:22.370
The sky's really high!

00:03:22.960 --> 00:03:24.440
It's completely autumn now.

00:03:25.220 --> 00:03:27.180
It's become a lot cooler too.

00:03:27.640 --> 00:03:29.550
I love autumn.

00:03:30.190 --> 00:03:32.850
Pears, grapes, chestnuts and matsutake mushrooms...

00:03:33.460 --> 00:03:36.790
Please buy your autumn harvests at Nat-chan's market!

00:03:37.360 --> 00:03:38.430
Morning, Sunao.

00:03:38.910 --> 00:03:39.530
Morning.

00:03:40.420 --> 00:03:40.980
Mornin'.

00:03:41.610 --> 00:03:42.250
Morning.

00:03:43.270 --> 00:03:44.930
What's up, Sunao? Wearing winter clothes already?

00:03:45.250 --> 00:03:45.640
Yeah.

00:03:46.180 --> 00:03:48.340
Can't summer come any faster!?

00:03:48.620 --> 00:03:49.560
Is it the bare arms?

00:03:52.290 --> 00:03:53.410
What a pervert!

00:03:53.670 --> 00:03:54.690
I love summer!

00:04:03.120 --> 00:04:04.800
You're already wearing winter clothes, Moriyama?

00:04:05.440 --> 00:04:07.730
I wonder if you'll be getting winter hair soon, Poteko?

00:04:07.990 --> 00:04:08.720
Winter hair!?

00:04:09.920 --> 00:04:10.480
Winter hair...

00:04:12.780 --> 00:04:15.400
Winter hair...I want...I want...

00:04:16.440 --> 00:04:18.100
I want winter hair too!

00:04:19.460 --> 00:04:23.130
This feels...so good!

00:04:20.500 --> 00:04:23.160
People are looking, Mudo! They're looking!

00:04:26.380 --> 00:04:28.330
Cheer up, Mudo.

00:04:29.110 --> 00:04:31.290
I don't think anyone's really bothered about it.

00:04:33.460 --> 00:04:36.870
Don't be so depressed and be positive about it. Okay?

00:04:39.500 --> 00:04:42.350
H-Hey S-Sunao! Did you do your homework yet?

00:04:42.480 --> 00:04:42.920
Yeah.

00:04:43.080 --> 00:04:47.480
For this question, I just can't figure out this part and it's really bugging me.

00:04:47.960 --> 00:04:49.180
Oh, this part?

00:04:49.750 --> 00:04:51.940
First you solve for the radius...

00:04:56.350 --> 00:04:57.920
There's a faint trace of ammonia...

00:05:00.980 --> 00:05:03.220
Change into this jersey, Mudo.

00:05:05.320 --> 00:05:06.400
It couldn't be helped.

00:05:06.400 --> 00:05:09.540
You were nervous.

00:05:09.590 --> 00:05:10.320
I see.

00:05:10.740 --> 00:05:14.260
My nervousness must've shown and made her tense.

00:05:14.930 --> 00:05:17.730
Next time I'll do it more naturally...naturally...

00:05:18.580 --> 00:05:19.940
Good luck, me.

00:05:32.270 --> 00:05:35.300
Sunao! Punish me! Punish me...!

00:05:39.160 --> 00:05:39.660
Sunao.

00:05:41.650 --> 00:05:43.890
I'm really sorry I got your uniform wet.

00:05:44.060 --> 00:05:47.380
This is our club's uniform so if you want, you can wear it.

00:05:49.170 --> 00:05:50.520
I guess I'll leave them here to dry.

00:05:53.330 --> 00:05:56.660
Listen, watch them so that they don't fly away.

00:05:58.470 --> 00:06:03.530
Speaking of passion, he asked "Is it 'menchibou'?" but,

00:06:03.630 --> 00:06:10.560
the teacher put on a more serious face and corrected him, "It's not 'menchibou' but 'tochimenbou'."

00:06:03.630 --> 00:06:10.560
Note: "menchibou" seems to be a type of food with minced meat on a stick.
"tochimenbou" seems to be the name of a theatre.

00:06:10.880 --> 00:06:11.860
Alright, stop there.

00:06:14.130 --> 00:06:14.680
Moriyama.

00:06:15.020 --> 00:06:15.490
Yes.

00:06:16.050 --> 00:06:17.070
Try writing out this word.

00:06:23.190 --> 00:06:27.230
And then those two accidentally saw the mafia killing.

00:06:27.680 --> 00:06:29.170
They were then were framed for it.

00:06:30.020 --> 00:06:31.060
What do you think happened next?

00:06:31.790 --> 00:06:32.560
I don't know.

00:06:32.600 --> 00:06:35.890
Well, they hid themselves in an all girl band.

00:06:36.260 --> 00:06:36.820
Just imagine it.

00:06:38.240 --> 00:06:39.770
That's kind of interesting.

00:06:40.390 --> 00:06:42.890
And the last line was so awesome!

00:06:43.460 --> 00:06:44.960
"Perfect people don't---"

00:06:45.060 --> 00:06:46.150
Wait, what's with the skirt!?

00:06:46.950 --> 00:06:48.700
I thought something was weird!

00:06:48.840 --> 00:06:50.310
I see, it's the skirts!

00:06:50.950 --> 00:06:51.960
Kirihara Mudo.

00:06:52.420 --> 00:06:54.280
A member of the boys cheerleading club.

00:06:54.780 --> 00:06:56.030
Currently recruiting new members.

00:06:57.240 --> 00:07:06.790
On an autumn evening, there's a shining rainbow over the mountain.

00:07:07.220 --> 00:07:16.820
There isn't much love, but there's a lot inside me.

00:07:17.240 --> 00:07:19.610
The first colour...

00:07:23.990 --> 00:07:28.130
Moriyama-kun! I can see it in that pose! I can see it!

00:07:28.430 --> 00:07:29.300
I'm a boy though.

00:07:29.300 --> 00:07:33.090
No! Absolutely no! No!

00:07:33.650 --> 00:07:35.230
You should cherish yourself more!

00:07:35.830 --> 00:07:37.680
Have some sense of embarassment, Moriyama-kun!

00:07:39.340 --> 00:07:42.630
Hey, this guy brought in some idol pictures!

00:07:43.560 --> 00:07:44.920
Give them back!

00:07:47.460 --> 00:07:49.630
A-Act normal, Moriyama.

00:07:49.950 --> 00:07:52.570
When you try to hide them, we feel embarassed too.

00:07:56.160 --> 00:08:01.170
Skirts are

00:07:58.670 --> 00:08:01.170
difficult...

00:08:01.610 --> 00:08:04.460
Alright! On to the science room!

00:08:04.640 --> 00:08:07.090
Stop explaining every little thing we do!

00:08:13.460 --> 00:08:14.090
Mikan.

00:08:16.200 --> 00:08:18.330
I went into the wrong room!

00:08:27.670 --> 00:08:32.130
Skirts are

00:08:28.710 --> 00:08:32.130
really

00:08:29.760 --> 00:08:32.130
difficult...

00:08:37.160 --> 00:08:38.640
That's something Moriyama would do.

00:08:39.120 --> 00:08:40.620
Boys have it real good though.

00:08:41.230 --> 00:08:43.380
Their world changes just because of one skirt.

00:08:44.120 --> 00:08:45.310
It seems really fun.

00:08:47.050 --> 00:08:50.480
It's completely normal when a girl wears some pants.

00:08:50.930 --> 00:08:52.170
I'm jealous.

00:08:52.670 --> 00:08:54.180
You seem to be having enough fun though.

00:09:11.000 --> 00:09:13.750
By the way, Mikan, what part of Moriyama do you like?

00:09:14.730 --> 00:09:15.390
His looks?

00:09:19.290 --> 00:09:20.890
H-He's kind...

00:09:21.970 --> 00:09:25.010
And...t-that's right...

00:09:26.350 --> 00:09:27.810
If I had to say then...

00:09:29.230 --> 00:09:31.430
Those eyes like a winter tide...

00:09:32.480 --> 00:09:33.830
That fine black hair...

00:09:34.960 --> 00:09:38.210
Though small, he holds a lot of strength...

00:09:39.420 --> 00:09:45.070
Yes! It's as if he's like a gallant growing fawn!

00:09:45.490 --> 00:09:52.420
And that clumsy kindness that boys have had me completely fascinated.

00:09:53.500 --> 00:09:55.550
That was an unforgettable summer day.

00:09:57.220 --> 00:09:59.710
At that moment I had thought,

00:09:59.960 --> 00:10:02.250
"Ah! This was a fateful meeting!"

00:10:02.480 --> 00:10:05.810
"I was born to meet this person!"

00:10:05.930 --> 00:10:06.890
Hey, Guchuko!

00:10:10.290 --> 00:10:11.450
Hey, Potemayo.

00:10:13.700 --> 00:10:15.550
Here, it's completely dry now.

00:10:22.370 --> 00:10:23.210
It's all warm and fuzzy.

00:10:24.190 --> 00:10:26.220
Translation: Warm and fuzzy~

00:10:30.160 --> 00:10:32.110
Translation: Warm and fuzzy~

00:10:50.320 --> 00:10:51.960
You're all warm and fuzzy.

00:10:52.200 --> 00:10:54.310
She was sleeping under the sun whole time.

00:10:54.680 --> 00:10:56.640
Hey, let me hold her too.

00:10:56.840 --> 00:10:57.210
Here.

00:10:59.210 --> 00:11:01.550
She's all warm and fuzzy and it feels good!

00:11:05.000 --> 00:11:05.720
Mudo...

00:11:06.550 --> 00:11:08.210
You're not warm and fuzzy!

00:11:09.280 --> 00:11:10.490
Sorry, Mudo.

00:11:16.940 --> 00:11:18.280
Let's go home.

00:11:21.450 --> 00:11:23.470
You're still warm.

00:11:38.020 --> 00:11:40.790
"By the way, Mikan, what part of Moriyama do you like?"

00:11:41.550 --> 00:11:42.220
"His looks?"

00:11:43.130 --> 00:11:45.520
Geez, those two just don't understand.

00:11:46.280 --> 00:11:47.840
Moriyama-kun's charm is...

00:11:49.680 --> 00:11:52.870
Those wavering eyes, his conviction and his kindess...

00:11:53.900 --> 00:11:58.670
There are too few and clumsy words to be able to describe it all.

00:11:59.760 --> 00:12:02.090
In order not to miss any of his charms,

00:12:02.460 --> 00:12:06.250
I forget to blink and gaze at each and every one of them with pleasure.

00:12:07.070 --> 00:12:12.510
To begin with, it was a complete coincidence that I had noticed his brilliance!

00:12:13.500 --> 00:12:14.240
Coincidence...

00:12:15.020 --> 00:12:16.750
...it could also be called fate!

00:12:19.620 --> 00:12:20.930
They say she stayed in the bath too long.

00:12:21.170 --> 00:12:24.090
Mikan-san spaces out a lot.

00:12:24.320 --> 00:12:25.510
How scary...

00:12:42.030 --> 00:12:44.650
Two months have passed since they met.

00:12:45.050 --> 00:12:48.250
Moriyama Sunao had finally come to think,

00:12:48.960 --> 00:12:52.130
"What exactly is Potemayo?"

00:13:08.680 --> 00:13:11.680
Sweetened Bread 3 for

00:13:08.680 --> 00:13:11.680
200 yen!

00:13:09.150 --> 00:13:10.900
Three sweetened bread for 200 yen.

00:13:13.390 --> 00:13:15.010
Br-Bre-Bread!

00:13:18.910 --> 00:13:20.360
Let's go buy some sweetened bread.

00:13:21.790 --> 00:13:28.030
Sunday

00:13:22.850 --> 00:13:26.150
I love, I love, I love, I love bread.

00:13:26.310 --> 00:13:28.480
Let's eat bread!

00:13:28.670 --> 00:13:29.040
Bread!

00:13:30.710 --> 00:13:31.540
B-Bread!

00:13:43.880 --> 00:13:44.230
Bread!

00:13:45.720 --> 00:13:46.080
Bread!

00:13:47.630 --> 00:13:49.640
Y-You got me!

00:13:50.330 --> 00:13:51.530
What a nice person.

00:13:50.330 --> 00:13:51.730
Note: "Pan!" is the sound of a gunshot.

00:13:55.560 --> 00:13:58.600
Listen, behave yourself while we're here.

00:14:19.060 --> 00:14:20.510
You don't have to hold your breath.

00:14:24.980 --> 00:14:27.250
Bread

00:14:24.980 --> 00:14:27.250
Snacks

00:14:30.230 --> 00:14:31.790
I see. You like that song.

00:14:39.380 --> 00:14:42.600
Mama! A cat! There's a weird cat!

00:14:42.900 --> 00:14:44.000
Is that so?

00:14:54.720 --> 00:14:55.560
Let's go with these.

00:14:58.880 --> 00:14:59.520
Potemayo?

00:15:00.520 --> 00:15:01.220
Potemayo!?

00:15:00.970 --> 00:15:03.000
Mama! A cat! A cat!

00:15:07.970 --> 00:15:08.880
That was scary, huh?

00:15:09.510 --> 00:15:10.410
Stay there for now.

00:15:10.590 --> 00:15:12.930
Curry

00:15:10.590 --> 00:15:12.930
Miso●Soy Sauce

00:15:27.190 --> 00:15:27.990
Sorry about that.

00:15:28.760 --> 00:15:29.510
Stay in here.

00:15:34.730 --> 00:15:38.010
I've got to keep an eye on her when there are a lot of people around.

00:15:38.860 --> 00:15:39.950
She's still a kid.

00:15:41.410 --> 00:15:42.120
No wait...

00:15:43.250 --> 00:15:45.770
She looks like a kid but could already be an adult.

00:15:49.830 --> 00:15:53.200
In the first place, just exactly what kind of organism is Potemayo?

00:15:54.610 --> 00:15:58.560
Popsicles 5 for

00:15:54.610 --> 00:15:58.560
300yen!

00:15:58.560 --> 00:16:02.480
Popsicles 5 for

00:15:58.560 --> 00:16:02.480
300yen!

00:16:00.450 --> 00:16:01.200
Oh, yeah...

00:16:02.870 --> 00:16:04.440
Let's buy vegetables at Natsu's store.

00:16:06.920 --> 00:16:09.680
Welcome, welcome! It's cheap! Cheap!

00:16:10.470 --> 00:16:12.080
Thank you very much.

00:16:13.430 --> 00:16:14.680
Welcome!

00:16:16.050 --> 00:16:16.780
Moriyama-kun!?

00:16:17.450 --> 00:16:17.880
Hi.

00:16:20.440 --> 00:16:21.260
Potatoes...

00:16:21.540 --> 00:16:24.270
Amazing. Just amazing...

00:16:24.640 --> 00:16:26.230
That charm's effect...

00:16:26.300 --> 00:16:30.800
A charm to

00:16:26.300 --> 00:16:30.800
meet your loved one accidently ♥

00:16:27.060 --> 00:16:30.090
A charm to meet your loved one accidently.

00:16:32.510 --> 00:16:38.010
While thinking of your loved one's name, hold a nice and clean tissue.

00:16:38.570 --> 00:16:43.280
If you're able to tear a side off the tissue completely, your wish will come true 100%!

00:16:44.370 --> 00:16:45.740
And some onions...

00:16:46.860 --> 00:16:48.070
Amazing!

00:16:48.120 --> 00:16:50.830
No, Moriyama-kun! Take some tissue instead of onions!

00:16:51.180 --> 00:16:53.130
Tear it! Tear it! Tear it mo---

00:16:51.660 --> 00:16:53.130
What are you saying?

00:16:53.510 --> 00:16:54.310
Dad...

00:16:56.390 --> 00:16:57.340
What is this?

00:16:58.250 --> 00:16:59.140
Potemayo.

00:17:01.460 --> 00:17:02.170
Potemayo?

00:17:02.470 --> 00:17:03.320
Dad...

00:17:25.680 --> 00:17:27.170
Are you okay, Pote-chan?

00:17:27.880 --> 00:17:29.560
Sorry about that.

00:17:29.970 --> 00:17:32.810
Who's boy is that?

00:17:32.920 --> 00:17:35.080
That's the rumoured Moriyama-kun!

00:17:36.450 --> 00:17:39.390
Ah, Mikan's boyfriend!

00:17:39.430 --> 00:17:42.020
Stop it! Stop it!

00:17:42.720 --> 00:17:45.280
Sorry about what my husband did.

00:17:45.570 --> 00:17:48.070
No, I don't think it was a big deal.

00:17:48.870 --> 00:17:50.580
Are you doing errands for your mom?

00:17:51.770 --> 00:17:53.010
How remarkable!

00:17:53.370 --> 00:17:53.710
No...

00:17:56.820 --> 00:17:58.490
You want to make lunch for Moriyama?

00:17:59.050 --> 00:18:00.240
Yeah, I think that's a good idea.

00:18:01.010 --> 00:18:03.820
I don't think he eats much handmade stuff.

00:18:04.960 --> 00:18:07.420
If I recall, I don't think he has a mom.

00:18:08.930 --> 00:18:09.910
Or was it his dad?

00:18:10.350 --> 00:18:12.600
Ah, wait. It's remembering time.

00:18:15.530 --> 00:18:20.090
By the way, I didn't think there'd be a new Stallone movie after all this time!

00:18:21.250 --> 00:18:23.260
What are you remembering, you idiot dog?

00:18:26.850 --> 00:18:28.920
The bill comes to 420 yen!

00:18:29.280 --> 00:18:31.170
What's with the loud voice?

00:18:31.670 --> 00:18:33.870
I'm sorry for being loud, Moriyama-kun!

00:18:34.530 --> 00:18:35.580
No, it's okay.

00:18:36.570 --> 00:18:39.300
The two apples are service so eat them with Pote-chan.

00:18:40.810 --> 00:18:41.220
But...

00:18:41.540 --> 00:18:43.810
It's okay! If they're good then...

00:18:44.510 --> 00:18:46.940
...come here again...or not...

00:18:52.760 --> 00:18:53.430
Thanks.

00:18:58.270 --> 00:18:59.870
What is it this time?

00:19:00.080 --> 00:19:01.330
They say it's anemia.

00:19:01.600 --> 00:19:02.810
How scary...

00:19:27.860 --> 00:19:28.870
Mudo!

00:19:29.090 --> 00:19:30.010
I bought ice cre---

00:19:30.120 --> 00:19:32.850
Mudo! Mudo!

00:19:38.520 --> 00:19:41.870
After buying the needed vegetables, today's dinner is curry.

00:19:43.800 --> 00:19:48.710
The ingredients are chicken breast, potatoes, onions, carrots and curry base.

00:19:49.210 --> 00:19:50.490
First prepare the chicken.

00:20:01.790 --> 00:20:04.020
As usual, the chick was cannabilizing.

00:20:07.560 --> 00:20:11.680
Mikan! Stop spacing out and get out!

00:20:11.900 --> 00:20:13.820
You'll get carried away by the ambulance again!

00:20:14.220 --> 00:20:15.280
Okay!

00:20:20.870 --> 00:20:24.880
I sure was surprised that Moriyama-kun came to our store though.

00:20:25.670 --> 00:20:28.120
"If I recall, I don't think he has a mom."

00:20:37.790 --> 00:20:39.700
It's alright, Moriyama-kun.

00:20:40.260 --> 00:20:43.770
Everyone's here for you like Pote-chan and even me...

00:20:46.340 --> 00:20:49.360
Becoming a bride!? Something daring like that...!

00:20:49.360 --> 00:20:51.610
That's enough, Mikan!

00:21:01.170 --> 00:21:01.760
Potemayo.

00:21:02.820 --> 00:21:04.570
Here, come onto the futon.

00:21:09.200 --> 00:21:10.070
Blow your nose.

00:21:12.950 --> 00:21:13.390
How is it now?

00:21:14.850 --> 00:21:15.600
Let's sleep then.

00:21:24.460 --> 00:21:27.320
Just what is she?

00:21:28.530 --> 00:21:30.720
Where did she come from and for what?

00:21:32.820 --> 00:21:34.780
Well, she's warm.

00:21:41.500 --> 00:21:44.260
I guess those things don't matter.

00:23:26.100 --> 00:23:27.040
Next episode preview.

00:23:27.410 --> 00:23:29.740
It's sudden, but the next story will take place in winter.

00:23:30.740 --> 00:23:33.950
It'll be a Christmas story and Sunao's dad will appear!

